## Summary Checklist

- [ ] Component types defined in `src/types/components/`
- [ ] Theme type inference setup (no circular references)
- [ ] Props are optional with default values (for forwardRef & Storybook compatibility)
- [ ] Props separated into behavior (\_ComponentProps) and styling (ComponentStylesProps)
- [ ] Style function uses ComponentStylesProps type (DRY principle)
- [ ] Style logic separated into functions
- [ ] Type assertion `as ComponentType` used (for polymorphic components)
- [ ] Component composition uses simple wrappers (no redundant forwardRef)
- [ ] External libraries wrapped properly for ref and style support
- [ ] Full TypeScript type safety maintained

This pattern is production-tested and widely used in enterprise design systems.
